 "segments": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.12,
   "text": "I'm never holding my son down for a freeze again."
  },
  {
   "s": 2.52,
   "e": 6.62,
   "text": "Last time he screamed, a wart on his foot for a year."
  },
  {
   "s": 7.18,
   "e": 9.54,
   "text": "Store acid was too painful for him."
  },
  {
   "s": 10.08,
   "e": 11.74,
   "text": "So the doctor froze it."
  },
  {
   "s": 12.32,
   "e": 13.18,
   "text": "We held him still."
  },
  {
   "s": 13.84,
   "e": 16.28,
   "text": "He screamed, and it grew back anyway."
  },
  {
   "s": 17.02,
   "e": 18.9,
   "text": "Turns out, I didn't fail him."
  },
  {
   "s": 19.5,
   "e": 20.62,
   "text": "Here's what the freeze missed."
  },
  {
   "s": 20.98,
   "e": 25.98,
   "text": "Freezing, acid, and shaving only snap off the top, like picking a dandelion."
  },
  {
   "s": 25.98,
   "e": 29.58,
   "text": "The root stays under the hard skin, so it grows back."
  },
  {
   "s": 30.32,
   "e": 31.86,
   "text": "That's why I switched to root out."
  },
  {
   "s": 32.34,
   "e": 34.18,
   "text": "It's an oil with four plants in it."
  },
  {
   "s": 34.64,
   "e": 36.62,
   "text": "The lemon opens up that hard skin."
  },
  {
   "s": 37.2,
   "e": 41.36,
   "text": "The tea tree carries it down, up to eight times deeper than a regular cream,"
  },
  {
   "s": 41.72,
   "e": 45.08,
   "text": "and the pokeweed and white cedar break the wort down from the root."
  },
  {
   "s": 45.64,
   "e": 46.98,
   "text": "Deep doesn't mean harsh."
  },
  {
   "s": 47.54,
   "e": 50.04,
   "text": "It's a kid's formula, ages four and up."
  },
  {
   "s": 50.48,
   "e": 54.9,
   "text": "No blister, just a little cool tingle, recommended by pediatricians."
  },
  {
   "s": 54.9,
   "e": 57.02,
   "text": "Bedtime takes two minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": 57.56,
   "e": 59.88,
   "text": "First, two light strokes with the file."
  },
  {
   "s": 60.4,
   "e": 61.66,
   "text": "That opens up the hardtop."
  },
  {
   "s": 62.06,
   "e": 63.08,
   "text": "Only the hardtop."
  },
  {
   "s": 63.42,
   "e": 65.4,
   "text": "Never his skin, so it doesn't hurt."
  },
  {
   "s": 65.98,
   "e": 67.64,
   "text": "Next, I brush the oil on."
  },
  {
   "s": 68.16,
   "e": 70.04,
   "text": "Then, a clear dot seals it in,"
  },
  {
   "s": 70.26,
   "e": 71.82,
   "text": "so it keeps soaking all night."
  },
  {
   "s": 72.44,
   "e": 73.38,
   "text": "No cold can."
  },
  {
   "s": 73.9,
   "e": 74.56,
   "text": "No acid."
  },
  {
   "s": 75.16,
   "e": 76.38,
   "text": "Nobody holds him down."
  },
  {
   "s": 77.02,
   "e": 78.0,
   "text": "My son's five."
  },
  {
   "s": 78.54,
   "e": 79.58,
   "text": "He hated the freeze."
  },
  {
   "s": 80.32,
   "e": 82.58,
   "text": "This, he just sticks his foot out at bedtime."
  },
  {
   "s": 82.58,
   "e": 89.42,
   "text": "Does it sting? He says it's just a little cool. We call it his wart chapstick."
  },
  {
   "s": 92.9,
   "e": 97.22,
   "text": "Two minutes at bedtime. No holding him down. No fight."
  },
  {
   "s": 97.44,
   "e": 101.26,
   "text": "Another freeze he cries through. Or two minutes at bedtime."
  },
  {
   "s": 101.94,
   "e": 106.04,
   "text": "Tap the link below and check if buy two, get one free is still on."
  },
  {
   "s": 106.46,
   "e": 109.4,
   "text": "And you're covered by our 90-day money back guarantee."
  },
  {
   "s": 115.48,
   "e": 116.88,
   "text": "You"
  }
 ]
